  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pastel_Shaders/BH_Pastel_Shaders_Header.png\" alt=\"Pastel 光影標誌\" width=\"1024\" height=\"324\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ffe8e9&amp;labelColor=ffced2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=blue\" width=\"205\" height=\"26\" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<em><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支援-IRIS,%20OCULUS,%20OPTIFINE%20|%201.7%20至%201.20-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;labelColor=ffced2\" width=\"385\" height=\"28\" />&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/elocindev\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ElocinDev-支持我們-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Ko-Fi&amp;labelColor=ffced2\" width=\"212\" height=\"27\" /></a></em><em>&nbsp;</em>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/ELOCIN\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pastel_Shaders/BH_Pastel_Shaders_Promo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1018\" height=\"151\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Pastel 光影是一款風格美學的光影包，內含多種色彩預設</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1066006073456197652/presets-transparent.gif\" alt=\"Pastel 光影中的三種預設\" width=\"1200\" height=\"608\" /><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1066223943956041748/highperformance.png\" alt=\"Pastel 是一款高效能光影\" width=\"1120\" height=\"567\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>🎨 多種色彩預設</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">從粉紅色、藍色到黃色的柔和色調應有盡有！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>🌌 悠閒氛圍</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">接近原版的體驗，搭配清澈星空。美麗的日出與日落。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>✏️ 高度自訂化</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">無論新手或進階用戶，自訂簡單且幾乎無限制！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>⚙️ 使用者友善設定選單</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">太多設定讓你不知所措？Pastel 提供快速設定，如同多數現代遊戲。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>💻 在大多數現代電腦上運行</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">針對現代低階顯示卡甚至內建顯示晶片最佳化！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>☁️ <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/shader/insanity-shader\">Insanity 光影包</a> 的姊妹作</strong></span>\n<p>Pastel 是 Insanity 的相反版本，基於 BSL 光影 ♥ 打造！</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
